## Prose

Your brain is an Obsidian vault. Use `mcp__brain__read_note` to open files by
their vault-relative path. Use `mcp__brain__search_notes` for keyword queries
across every note in the vault. The vault has two entry hubs: the coding-playbook
hub at `coding-playbook/coding-playbook.md` and the research hub at
`research/research.md`. Start from the relevant hub for your task, follow
wikilinks (`[[note-name]]`) to deepen context, and check those notes' links too.
Stay in scope; don't follow links into unrelated topics.

## Playbook hub

